yy
Sweats 
yy
Cough
yy
Hiccups
yy
Anorexia
yy
Weight loss
yy
Jaundice (uncommon)
yy
Concurrent diarrhoea (less than one-third of patients)
Signs
yy
Large tender liver 
yy
Tenderness and/or bulging at right intercostal spaces
yy
Jaundice 
yy
Dullness to percussion on the right lower chest zones with basal 
crepitations
yy
Amoebic empyema following extension into the chest cavity 
yy
Peritonitis (uncommon)

