yy
Restlessness or feeling on edge 
yy
Being easily fatigued
yy
Difficulty concentrating or mind going blank
yy
Irritability
yy
Sleep disturbance (difficulty falling asleep or frequent waken­
ing)
yy
Palpitations
 
