such as danazol, stanozolol and nandrolone 
yy
Use of pomades, especially products that contain lanolin, petrolatum, 
vegetable oils, butyl stearate, lauryl alcohol and oleic acid
yy
Contraceptive agents: medroxyprogesterone injection, implanted or 
