dom tests at home by the patient using a glucose meter
yy
Periodic fasting or random tests during clinic reviews
yy
Glycated haemoglobin (HbA1c) (at least twice a year)
yy
Blood lipid tests (annually, but more frequently if levels abnormal or 
on lipid lowering medication)
