4 ml/kg body weight over 1-3 minutes through a large vein
Then
5% solution
According to total daily fluid requirement until blood glucose levels 
normalise
2nd Line Treatment
Evidence Rating: [A]
yy
Glucagon, IV, IM or subcutaneous, 
Adults
1 mg stat. 
Children
8-18 years (bodyweight > 25 kg); 	 1 mg stat.
8-18 years (bodyweight < 25 kg); 	 500 micrograms stat.
1 month-8 years; 	
	
500 micrograms stat.
