yy
Exposure to blood or body fluids contaminated with blood from an HIV 
positive patient with high viral load
yy
Injury with a hollow bore needle/deep and extensive injury from a con­
taminated sharp instrument
yy
Exposure to blood from an HIV drug resistant patient
