facilities. More than 80% of people will have at least one episode in their 
lifetime. Most are benign and will resolve. However, 33%-66% will have a 
recurrence within a year. It is important to identify red, and yellow flags. It 
may be acute if it is less than 3 months and chronic if it is more.
