Malnourished with discoloured hair
yy
Deformities 
yy
Small for age
yy
Swelling of wrists
yy
Rachitic rosary
Investigations
yy
Serum vitamin-D level
yy
Serum calcium
yy
Serum and urine phosphate levels
yy
X-ray of deformed bones

